  "interpretation": {
    "auto_generated": true,
    "text": "ARIMA(0,1,1)(0,1,1)[12] was fitted to 132 observations of passengers (training MAPE = 2.6%; hold-out MAPE = 2.9%). The forecast for 1961 Dec is 506.8, 95% interval [378.8, 678.2]."
